{"quest_id": 6865, "name": "力の余波", "description": "平和を取り戻していたはずの王国近郊の\n村が、魔物に襲撃された。一行は異変を\n感じつつも急ぎ救援に駆け付ける。\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "紅の魔術師と魔界の騎士", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920133, "map_no": 5524, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 150, "gold": 700, "drops": [{"card": 6, "c": 2}, {"card": 55, "c": 1}, {"item": 1005, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 25, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 40}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 720, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 720, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2103216, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 262, "global_id": 261, "spawn_sec": 98}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "base_hp": 640, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097216, "master_id": 4, "spawn_sec": 126}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 151}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "兵士Ａ", "text": "――まさかここまで\n魔物に攻め込まれるとは……！", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "兵士Ｂ", "text": "住民の避難を最優先だ！\nあと少し……あと少しで王子達の本隊が到着する。\nそれまで何としてでも持ちこたえるんだ！", "face": "u64"}, {"name": "兵士Ａ", "text": "しかしこちらの戦力では魔物の相手など……。\n……おや？　向こうに見えるのは――", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "――お待たせしました！\n戦況はどうなっていますか？", "face": "le7721f601444"}, {"name": "兵士Ａ", "text": "政務官殿！　王子！！\n村人の避難は進んでいますが、\n魔物と戦うには手数が足りていない状況です……っ。", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "なるほど……。\n巡回の兵のみでよく持ちこたえてくれました。\n魔物の討伐はこちらで引き受けます。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "兵士Ｂ", "text": "――はっ！\n我々は引き続き、村人の護衛につきます！！", "face": "u64"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "村の被害は甚大です。\n王子、急いで魔物を退けましょう！", "face": "le7721f601444"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ケイティ", "text": "――魔物の討伐、完了しました。\nお疲れさまです、王子。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "魔物の侵攻も激しくなるばかりですね……。\nこんな王国の近くの村まで襲撃を受けるなんて……。", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "魔王ガリウスが、強大な魔の力を手にしたことも\n魔物が活発化している原因なのでしょうか？", "face": "l25aeaf0e25c9"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "本格的な侵攻に備えた訓練なのか、\n魔王の力にあてられた魔物の暴走かはともかく、\n無関係とは言えないでしょうね……。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "今回は救援が間に合いましたが、\nこちらが手数で劣る上、常に後手となる以上、\nどちらにせよ何か対策を打たないといけません。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ヴァレリー", "text": "――その対策になれるかどうかは分からないけど、\n王子、ひとつ朗報を届けにきたよ。", "face": "u12"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ヴァレリーさん？\n朗報とはいったい……？"}, {"name": "ヴァレリー", "text": "詳しい話は王国に戻ってからにしよう。\n魔法都市から彼らが来ているからね。", "face": "u12"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "なるほど……？\nそれでは王子、一度王国に帰還しましょう。"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920133_5524", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 30, "y": 437}, {"k": "m", "x": 158, "y": 187, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 270, "y": 198, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 403, "y": 211, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 475, "y": 186, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 561, "y": 122, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 648, "y": 88, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 463, "y": 285, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 239, "y": 392, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 348, "y": 384, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 448, "y": 360, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 546, "y": 308, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 655, "y": 265, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 751, "y": 246, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 114, "y": 390, "id": 213}, {"k": "r", "x": 589, "y": 48, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 393, "y": 146, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 175, "y": 129, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 129, "y": 243, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 571, "y": 177, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 545, "y": 230, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 436, "y": 432, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 293, "y": 456, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 165, "y": 445, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 784, "y": 312, "id": 309}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "story_talk": true, "name_en": "Aftermath of Power", "description_en": "A village on the outskirts of the kingdom, which should have regained its peace, has been attacked by Monsters. The party senses something amiss and rushes to provide